  "releaseNotes": "Adds a typed .NET 10 DK Plus client with disposable manual creation, per-operation tenant/company/user context, asynchronous credential resolution, request-level authentication, current-UI-culture language negotiation with English fallback, recursive request validation, structured logging, full permission, product-inventory, vendor, vendor-invoice, and warehouse coverage, company and webhook administration, document generation and delivery operations, portable ERP reads, and legacy v1/v2 coverage.",
